{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-06",
  "title": "断弦",
  "storyCode": "6-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2fe67a2e24dd2b41d59aac5f79c09e37c7e12c52ca5317eb69ebe678d64dac83",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcity_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰喉！你在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，我已经和近卫局汇合了，现在正在辅助近卫局小队战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们马上就会赶去战场！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位精英干员，请听我说，这次可能会是我们在龙门唯一一次，也是最后一次的大型作战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请各位以完成自己的第一任务为优先目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对敌指挥官的围攻，我和我的小队会全力参与。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请各位记住一件事：我们的首要目标，是完成合约内容，和近卫局一同保障龙门的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但罗德岛在这次战斗中的任务，是减少感染者与普通市民间的摩擦，减少相互之间的冲突！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论抱着什么样的心态参与作战，我们都首先是罗德岛的一员！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论何时，无论何地！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。如果我们的行动实质上会违反我们的准则，我们会立刻停止战斗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我们依然该为这场作战负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "简直是说给我听的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她也担心太多事了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "再不快点，我们要赶不上了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没办法啊，刚才那些感染者有多难缠，你也亲眼见识过了。那可不是一个干员或者一支小队能对付的量和质。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，当时在天台上就该把那小子直接收了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，通讯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是再不到设伏地点准备，我就把过去一年所有的违纪档案全部交给凯尔希医生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很准时的！不要慌！马上就到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅！她在抓我的外套！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "煌！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我也没办法，这不是要赶路吗......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "（你给我记住了，一会儿有你好果子吃！）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士怎么没声音了？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......煌！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我什么都没做啊！这个人自己不说话！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你说两句给她听听啊！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "快说啊，为啥不说话啊......！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "请问能不能把我放下来再通讯呢？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "啊......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "抱歉博士，我忘了你和煌一起行动一定会是这种样子了......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "因地制宜嘛。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你在得意个什么劲，谁是地啊......"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以了，我只要知道你们的位置和行动就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们的关系还变得挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不对，怎么回事？我该怎么回答？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（不知道）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（不说话）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（不清楚）",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（很危险！现在很危险！我心态有损，我急需指点！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们加油。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她挂断了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完了。我也完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正已经到了，我们坐会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "可这里是区域内的最高点啊？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊~完蛋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我喜欢高处啊。反正两点间直线最短，我们一会儿跳下去就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这么高？跳下去？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。哈欠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等。我没看错的话......正在向埋伏圈移动的，东边的是梅菲斯特带着的队伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另一边......长鳞的小子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他还在带着队伍和什么交战。那黑压压一片是啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是牧群？这个数量是怎么回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来没法在这闲着了。走了，博士，这就是最后一战了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，阿米娅，喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我马上就和博士一起加入战场！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有什么打算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要放走一小部分整合运动，然后我们进贫民区追踪它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这不是给了那些特殊部队把柄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们也可以顺势再进入贫民区作业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经去探查过一次情况，有一点可以明确：只要我们还在，特殊部队就没法明目张胆地行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撑到战事结束，特殊部队也不好再动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不怕上司给你下命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁敢站出来声称“这支队伍是我的”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行啊，算盘打得挺好的。贫民区里的情况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的线人们一直在调查。除了少数失联的区域，我们掌握的情报会比其他人多得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这把赌的有点大，但我们确实得赌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在能让特殊部队回避的也就只有近卫局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，听得见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈长官，我们已经就位！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前，整合运动掳走感染者的事件，我向你致歉。如果我们考虑的更周到，这种事就不会发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......正是因为近卫局在贫民区的先期行动，龙门才能提前规划出对抗整合运动渗透的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在战略上，我认为陈长官没有责任。至于个人的问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈长官，米莎是没法死而复生的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我不会同意陈长官对感染者的看法。甚至陈长官自己也很清楚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在龙门，热爱龙门的龙门人会为龙门而战，不分身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，这只小兔子，好厉害啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是诗怀雅小姐的声音吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别管她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我认同你的看法，阿米娅，为龙门而战确实能团结起各种各样的人——那些投向整合运动的除外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但想要在龙门生活，又是另一件事。我不认为时间能改变一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然不能。是我们去改变一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种想法太天真了。感染者和普通人之间有着巨大的隔阂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米莎的死，无数感染者的死，这种事由不得我去天真什么，陈长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是这种隔阂把他们逼上死路。我们难道要让这个隔阂本身，成为我们不应该去消灭隔阂的理由？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望陈长官能真的理解......为什么我们罗德岛的感染者与非感染者，会为龙门而战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来了。陈长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准备战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埋伏圈！近卫局正在缩小包围圈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向贫民区方向突破。虽然我们没有弑君者的音信......但贫民区依然是我们唯一的出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带他走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和几支小队已经诱导了......“牧群”......聚向这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不会攻击我。利用这个特性，我可以和他们一起战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "轰炸他们的阵线！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们撑不了多久！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......呃啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有特殊感染者！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你要殿后？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你会一去无回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔，唔！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让他说吧。现在这个样子，他没法施术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅菲斯特......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要做什么！你要做什么！！回来！不要，不要！快回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说过，无论我要你做什么，你都会去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨沙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也说过，你不想做出自己的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，如果你真的有了自己的想法，想要去追随什么，我......不会责怪你选了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是那样的话......梅菲斯特，那样，真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经没有选择的余地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来我说的这些，会是我最后一个愿望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......萨沙？你在说什么，我不懂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别让他们走！击杀他们的指挥核心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......罗德岛的燕子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（口型：你该扣下扳机了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心，卧倒！火力太猛了，我们在被两面夹击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰喉",
      "speakerId": "char_367_swllow",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛的弩手，先后撤！这条通道就是为了这时候准备的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "浮士德！后退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弩手们，我相信霜星正在赶往这里。虽然弑君者下落不明，但她的部队说不定还在龙门贫民区之内。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果霜星来了，她会自动获得你们的全权指挥权。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我信任霜星。如果她来了，你们都能幸存。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，我的源石技艺，其实是可以让你们在移动中隐形的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "浮士德！我们知道，别用！你的感染器官会破裂的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事。我没有不用的理由了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "命令，撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......带他一起走。别去切尔诺伯格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......浮士德......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不能这样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望哪怕是一个人，你也要活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——这就是我最后一个愿望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨沙！！萨沙！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不想伤害别人。我也不想被别人伤害。这两件事，我都不想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果可以，当时我们就该逃走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们本来......可以逃走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨沙，你和我说好的，你和我约定好的！你说我们要一起活下去的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太迟了。我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......已经太累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨沙！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别了，伊诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他将弩矢搭在弩上，上弦。\n他瞄准，最后一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
